# ---- Evaluation reports: every run stays local; the baseline and the red team results are versioned ----
evals/reports/*
!evals/reports/.gitkeep
!evals/reports/baseline.json
!evals/reports/baseline.md
!evals/reports/red_team.json
!evals/reports/load_test.json

# ---- Docs (temporarily untracked: cleanup in progress, re-added at the end of the project) ----
# Exceptions: the documents already reviewed for publication, and the diagram, screenshot and
# demo used by the README, otherwise they would not render on GitHub.
# Git does not descend into an excluded directory, so the exclusion is written entry by entry.
docs/*
!docs/architecture.md
!docs/commands.txt
!docs/cost_analysis.md
!docs/model_card.md
!docs/assets/
docs/assets/*
!docs/assets/archi-simplified-v2.svg
!docs/assets/web-app.png
!docs/assets/demo.gif
!docs/assets/demo.mp4

# ---- OS / IDE ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
